			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732170101,
					"content": "此乃奧摩斯港港務主管所設公告板，奧摩斯港內外重要事務皆在此公示，如有問題也可在此留言。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7321702,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7321702
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7321702",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7321702,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732170201,
					"content": "「還在為論文格式困擾嗎？還在到處尋找論文靈感嗎？該試試新方法了！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732170202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732170202,
					"content": "「本人知論派出身，兼通素論派、妙論派，承接論文寫作輔導答疑業務。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732170203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732170203,
					"content": "「是時候脫離痛苦了，去旅店聯繫阿曼迪普先生吧，可以議價。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732170204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732170204,
					"content": "「可以代寫嗎？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732170205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732170205,
					"content": "「不行，監察官大人不會允許這種事情發生。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732170206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732170206,
					"content": "「確實，請潛心求學，不要心懷不軌。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7321703,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7321703
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7321703",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7321703,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732170301,
					"content": "你聽說過浮空術嗎？你見過空中飛人嗎？你想知道飛天馱獸背後隱藏的奧秘嗎？那就不要錯過楓丹飛天藝術團首次須彌展演！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732170302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732170302,
					"content": "歡迎光臨，莫失良機，隨到隨看，僅需五摩拉即可觀賞這一獨特的藝術展演。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732170303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732170303,
					"content": "「實在太精彩了，我在楓丹也沒看過這麼精彩的表演！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7321704,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7321704
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7321704",
